{"story":"<h1 id=\"style-de-la-page-avec-css\"><span data-effect-id=\"effect-1708618095495-28\" data-effect-type=\"invisible\" data-effect-subject=\"0898a17d99f5d946058cf77c3b5fcbd1\" data-effect-version=\"6848ad4d2326c1de436e5e05fd62a2e1\">Style de la Page avec CSS</span></h1><p>Maintenant que votre fichier CSS externe est configuré, vous pouvez commencer à styliser la page.</p><h2 id=\"exercice\"><span data-effect-id=\"effect-1708618074476-27\" data-effect-type=\"invisible\" data-effect-subject=\"565630f04d9b0e17e3f0a71b5700d5ba\" data-effect-version=\"270f30120d40d2276b2d2487380f0f0d\">Exercice :</span></h2><p>Créez une nouvelle règle CSS qui cible l&#x27;élément <code><strong>h1</strong></code>, et réglez sa propriété <code><strong>text-align</strong></code> sur <code><strong>center</strong></code>.</p><p>Pour rappel, voici comment cibler un paragraphe et l&#x27;agligner à droite:  <code>p { text-align: right; }</code></p>","subjectIndex":["0898a17d99f5d946058cf77c3b5fcbd1","565630f04d9b0e17e3f0a71b5700d5ba"],"subjects":{"0898a17d99f5d946058cf77c3b5fcbd1":{"created_at":1708613771611,"language":"html","name":"index.html","type":"code","versionIndex":["6848ad4d2326c1de436e5e05fd62a2e1"],"versions":{"6848ad4d2326c1de436e5e05fd62a2e1":{"created_at":1708615966134,"value":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fr\">\n  <head>\n    <title>Marqueurs Colorés</title>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <h1>Marqueurs de Couleur CSS</h1>\n  </body>\n</html>"}}},"565630f04d9b0e17e3f0a71b5700d5ba":{"created_at":1708612230870,"name":"Exercice","type":"iframe","versionIndex":["270f30120d40d2276b2d2487380f0f0d"],"versions":{"270f30120d40d2276b2d2487380f0f0d":{"value":"https://exercice.lkdigital.ninja/?subject=css&ex=exc2-6"}}}},"title":"Untitled","version":"0.3.1"}